        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>SGS Sliding Glass Door First Impressions Door Pull Smooth Modern Design.</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis door pull is the perfect compliment to sliding glass doors, common in coastal areas.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWhy keep using those same old 1960's style factory handles? You don't have to anymore. Now you have a choice! Update your sliding patio doors with this contemporary design pull.\r\n</p>\r\n<P>\r\nOther designs also available: <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Sliding Glass Door Pull Handles\"><b>Sliding Glass Door Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n*This door pull is available in 2 different lengths.<br>\r\n*It has a 1-inch thickness. <br>\r\n*There are 2 choices on the center to center measurement: 6-5/8\" or 9-5/8\"<br>\r\n*Door pull includes matching screw hardware.<br>\r\n*Door pulls are hand waxed with butchers wax to add longevity to the life of the finish.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\">\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSGS9 - Total Length 9\"<br>\r\nSGS12 - Total Length 12\"<br> \r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNow here's the really great part. These pulls are finished flat at each end, like the picture at the right or larger view. (the finish is Polished Chrome shown).\r\n</p>\r\nBut the best thing of all is you can order your sliding glass door with the finial of your choice! To make them even more personal to your decor.\r\n</p>\r\n<b>We have five kinds of finials, from left to right:</b> Large Pineapple, Small Reeded Acorn,  Small Smooth Acorn, Urn, and Large Acorn. Note that the the finials are sold and priced as a PAIR (2). Enough to do one door pull.\r\n</p>\r\n<b>NOTE:</b> The finials will have the same finish as the door pull you choose.\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-Finish-6-2.jpg?v=1704354524\" width=\"438\" height=\"173\" border=\"0\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (1 Door Pull).</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sliding Glass Door Pull Smooth Modern Design FII-SGS",
                "description": "SGS First Impressions International - Modern Sliding Glass Door Pulls. Update your sliding patio door with this contemporary design pull. ",
